{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your neighbor has insulted your lawn! It's time to show him that your lawn is the best on the block!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Extremely satisfying &amp; chill gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451380/extras/a0ca0702d8abe4afede38b1352e47ab2.poster.avif?t=1757453210\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451380/extras/a0ca0702d8abe4afede38b1352e47ab2.webm?t=1757453210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451380/extras/a0ca0702d8abe4afede38b1352e47ab2.mp4?t=1757453210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cut grass, buy upgrades, and collect<i> all</i>\u00a0the things to become a grass cutting legend!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use various tools and weapons to cut grass in a very satisfying way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase upgrades to increase the quality and quantity of your grass.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Harvest crops for passive income and try to collect each of the rare <i>Golden Crops</i>!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451380/extras/860ef3175e81b5d76c30f5cd5d6efe97.poster.avif?t=1757453210\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451380/extras/860ef3175e81b5d76c30f5cd5d6efe97.webm?t=1757453210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451380/extras/860ef3175e81b5d76c30f5cd5d6efe97.mp4?t=1757453210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragrap